Certisyn containment pilot pack

The directory pack/ is copied unchanged from the repository Certisyn-Inc/certisyn-drafts, pull request 12,
commit 8c01cd7a543d9e7359238958355d491f7923cf58, directory interop/containment-pilot/: MANIFEST.sha256 and the
36 files it lists. The README.md of that directory states that the verifier and the vectors are licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. A copy of the license is LICENSE.author in this directory.

Everything outside pack/ was added by proofbundle and is not part of the copied pack. proofbundle does not run
pack/verify.mjs or pack/run-all.mjs; they are kept so that pack/ is the pack as published.
tests/test_certisyn_containment_reader.py checks every line of pack/MANIFEST.sha256.
